  "12-040": "Identifies causes of delays before proposing solutions|Considers staffing, diagnostics, discharge and scheduling;Explains quality safeguards and sustainable workload|Measures both waiting time and care outcomes|Meeting targets by rushing care or moving queues elsewhere",
  "12-041": "Weighs timely care against the implications of outsourcing|Considers quality, continuity, cost and workforce availability;Protects equitable access and information transfer|Gives a conditional view with accountable contracts|Assuming private-sector treatment is automatically better or worse",
